{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A collection of tools to quickly create useful models as either STEP, STL, or DXF for 3D printing, CNC, and laser cutting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With an intuitive interface and streamlined tools, create complex parametric models quickly and easily, without the complexity of traditional CAD software.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grid Generator</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grid Row</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gridfinity Baseplate</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gridfinity Box</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rectangle Steps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Circle Steps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hexagon Grid</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Checkerboard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Circle Pattern</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Polygon</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Vase</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Star</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Braille</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">STEP Rotator</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">STEP to STL</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lissajous</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">QR</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Makerchip QR</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Puzzle Cube</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Living Hinge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3D Printing Calculator</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More tools and features are in the works.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3565810?t=1751979846","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565810/3b533e1855fc9df0d8796a07e237294ddbfeb7e8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751979846","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565810/2fe4209786e3e41575b0bfa1a4d8d30ed5672d57/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751979846"